  "content": {
    "id": "flow-cae33e78-88d6-48d3-98a0-05f46ed67834",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "16",
    "prompt": "For each function, find its inverse $f^{-1}(x)$ then verify $f(f^{-1}(x))=x$ and $f^{-1}(f(x))=x$.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "flow-3a9cf587-0372-46c0-9ce3-b79e3eba3b02",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^3+4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "flow-bb0f5b47-c1ba-4a50-bb33-ccb3ca75213e",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f^{-1}(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x-4}$, for $x\\in\\mathbb{R}$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=x^3+4\\\\x&=y^3+4\\\\y^3&=x-4\\\\y&=\\sqrt[3]{x-4}\\\\f^{-1}(x)&=\\sqrt[3]{x-4}\\end{align*}$$Both functions have domain $\\mathbb{R}$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42,
            "responseSpace": "scaffold"
          },
          {
            "id": "flow-1ead9103-fd98-472f-9182-5af3929cdd01",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "Verify $f(f^{-1}(x))=x$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f(f^{-1}(x))=x$, for all real $x$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(f^{-1}(x))&=\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x-4}\\right)^3+4\\\\&=(x-4)+4\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 27
          },
          {
            "id": "flow-5ab17f26-3b88-4ca6-8614-62498c2ed5e0",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "Verify $f^{-1}(f(x))=x$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f^{-1}(f(x))=x$, for all real $x$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f^{-1}(f(x))&=\\sqrt[3]{(x^3+4)-4}\\\\&=\\sqrt[3]{x^3}\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 27
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "flow-16a19ea8-6a62-41b2-90b9-a5d574e4d286",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=\\dfrac{2-x}{5+x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "flow-a85fa9ee-e1f1-44df-acb8-840f5aed81ce",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{2-5x}{1+x}$, $x\\ne-1$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\frac{2-x}{5+x}\\\\x&=\\frac{2-y}{5+y}\\\\x(5+y)&=2-y\\\\5x+xy&=2-y\\\\xy+y&=2-5x\\\\y(x+1)&=2-5x\\\\y&=\\frac{2-5x}{1+x}\\\\f^{-1}(x)&=\\frac{2-5x}{1+x}\\end{align*}$$The domain of $f$ is $\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{-5\\}$ and its range is $\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{-1\\}$. The inverse has domain $\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{-1\\}$ and range $\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{-5\\}$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 61,
            "responseSpace": "scaffold"
          },
          {
            "id": "flow-312704c0-5637-4a02-9ad5-62da140c8514",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "Verify $f(f^{-1}(x))=x$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f(f^{-1}(x))=x$, for $x\\ne-1$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(f^{-1}(x))&=\\frac{2-\\frac{2-5x}{1+x}}{5+\\frac{2-5x}{1+x}}\\\\&=\\frac{\\frac{2(1+x)-(2-5x)}{1+x}}{\\frac{5(1+x)+(2-5x)}{1+x}}\\\\&=\\frac{\\frac{7x}{1+x}}{\\frac{7}{1+x}}\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$Valid for $x\\ne-1$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42
          },
          {
            "id": "flow-7d08f9c8-c0ca-459d-bdd0-ae8b0085ac39",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "Verify $f^{-1}(f(x))=x$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f^{-1}(f(x))=x$, for $x\\ne-5$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f^{-1}(f(x))&=\\frac{2-5\\left(\\frac{2-x}{5+x}\\right)}{1+\\frac{2-x}{5+x}}\\\\&=\\frac{\\frac{2(5+x)-5(2-x)}{5+x}}{\\frac{5+x+(2-x)}{5+x}}\\\\&=\\frac{\\frac{7x}{5+x}}{\\frac{7}{5+x}}\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$Valid for $x\\ne-5$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "flow-d6e3ed22-e3e4-498e-bad5-43504f048da4",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x+5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "flow-6c20a830-2116-43ae-a6d3-e75c2152b3b3",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f^{-1}(x)=x^3-5$, for $x\\in\\mathbb{R}$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\sqrt[3]{x+5}\\\\x&=\\sqrt[3]{y+5}\\\\x^3&=y+5\\\\y&=x^3-5\\\\f^{-1}(x)&=x^3-5\\end{align*}$$Both functions have domain $\\mathbb{R}$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42,
            "responseSpace": "scaffold"
          },
          {
            "id": "flow-bf131ef9-e43b-487f-9567-34c3b7303375",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "Verify $f(f^{-1}(x))=x$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f(f^{-1}(x))=x$, for all real $x$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(f^{-1}(x))&=\\sqrt[3]{(x^3-5)+5}\\\\&=\\sqrt[3]{x^3}\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 27
          },
          {
            "id": "flow-fbdf752f-049e-43ac-83f0-9b65817bdedd",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "Verify $f^{-1}(f(x))=x$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$f^{-1}(f(x))=x$, for all real $x$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f^{-1}(f(x))&=\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x+5}\\right)^3-5\\\\&=(x+5)-5\\\\&=x\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 27
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
